Subject: anthropic-oauth provider — run engine mode on a Claude Code subscription

Base: alibaba/open-code-review v1.13.8 (4236c87)
Port of upstream PR #1670 "feat(llm): add Claude subscription OAuth provider"
(https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review/pull/1670, head 3724a85, unmerged).
Taken as `git diff b842659 3724a85` (PR-only changes, upstream merges excluded)
and applied to v1.13.8 without conflicts.

Each LLM call becomes one `claude -p` run with Claude Code's tools disabled and
a --json-schema decision envelope {content, tool_calls}; OCR keeps its own tool
loop, grouping, rounds, filter and relocation. Drop this patch once #1670 lands.

